endpoint.response:
{ success: true, message: "OK", data: {
    applied: { date_from, date_to, company_id: int[], company_site_id: int[], operational_site_id: int[], group_by: string },
    today: "YYYY-MM-DD",
    backlog: {
      work_orders_count: int, contract: number, invoiced: number, to_invoice: number,
      by_dimension: BacklogRow[],          (ordinate per label; "unattributed" ultimo, label null)
      by_age: BacklogAgeRow[]              (ordine 0_3, 3_6, 6_12, over_12; sempre 4 righe)
    },
    proforma: {
      issued: { documents: int, amount: number },           (created_at nel periodo, importo totale documento)
      converted: { documents: int, amount: number, average_days_to_invoice: int|null },
      open: { documents: int, amount: number },             (type = proforma a oggi)
      open_by_age: ProformaAgeRow[],                        (ordine 0_30, 31_60, 61_90, over_90; sempre 4 righe)
      average_days_invoice_to_collection: int|null,
      by_kind: ProformaKindRow[]                            (consultancy, institution, null; sempre 3 righe)
    }
} }
BacklogRow = { key: string, label: string|null, work_orders_count: int, contract: number, invoiced: number, to_invoice: number }
BacklogAgeRow = { bucket: "0_3"|"3_6"|"6_12"|"over_12", work_orders_count: int, to_invoice: number }
ProformaAgeRow = { bucket: "0_30"|"31_60"|"61_90"|"over_90", documents: int, amount: number }
ProformaKindRow = { kind: "consultancy"|"institution"|null, issued: int, converted: int, open: int, average_days_to_invoice: int|null }
Importi: contratto/fatturato imponibile (number 2 decimali); proforma sul totale documento. Invarianti:
somma di by_dimension = backlog (per funzione con residuo sull'ultima quota; i conteggi per funzione non si
sommano); somma di by_age = backlog.to_invoice e work_orders_count; somma by_kind.issued/converted/open =
proforma.issued/converted/open .documents.

{ success: true, message: "OK", data: {
    applied: { date_from, date_to, company_id: int[], company_site_id: int[], operational_site_id: int[] },
    collections: { total: number, installments: int, by_account: AccountRow[] },
    payments: { total: number, installments: int, by_account: AccountRow[] },
    by_month: { month: "YYYY-MM", collected: number, paid: number, net: number }[]   (tutti i mesi del periodo, in ordine)
} }
AccountRow = { account: { id: int, name: string, type: "bank_account"|"card"|"cash" } | null, amount: number, installments: int }
             (ordinate per amount decrescente; conto null = "unattributed", ultimo)
Importi sul totale documento. Invarianti: somma by_account = total; somma by_month.collected = collections.total; idem paid.
